@page page_installation_with_docker Installation with Docker

Here we maintain Dockerfiles for different compilers.

## Build

To build the Docker images, make sure to execute the following commands in the Peano root directory.

### Building the base images

```shell
docker build -t peanoframework/base -f docker/Dockerfile.base .
docker build -t peanoframework/spack -f docker/Dockerfile.spack .
docker build -t peanoframework/apptainer -f docker/Dockerfile.apptainer .
```

### Building the compiler images

```shell
docker build --build-arg SPACK_ENV_FILE=spack/compilers/amd/spack.yaml -t peanoframework/amd -f docker\Dockerfile.spack-env .
docker build --build-arg SPACK_ENV_FILE=spack/compilers/gcc/spack.yaml -t peanoframework/gcc -f docker\Dockerfile.spack-env .
docker build --build-arg SPACK_ENV_FILE=spack/compilers/intel/spack.yaml -t peanoframework/intel -f docker\Dockerfile.spack-env .
docker build --build-arg SPACK_ENV_FILE=spack/compilers/llvm/spack.yaml -t peanoframework/llvm -f docker\Dockerfile.spack-env .
docker build --build-arg SPACK_ENV_FILE=spack/compilers/nvidia/spack.yaml -t peanoframework/nvidia -f docker\Dockerfile.spack-env .
docker build -t peanoframework/targetdart -f docker/Dockerfile.targetdart .
```

Note that if you want to build the Intel image with GPU offloading (Codeplay plugins),
you can use the dedicated Dockerfile for that:

```shell
docker build -t peanoframework/intel -f docker/Dockerfile.intel .
```

### Building Extension Images

```shell
docker build -t peanoframework/exahype2 -f docker/Dockerfile.exahype2 .
```

## Usage

```shell
docker run -it -v ${PWD}:/work --rm --privileged peanoframework/<compiler> /bin/bash
```

### With GPU Support

```shell
docker run -it -v ${PWD}:/work --rm --gpus=all --privileged peanoframework/<compiler> /bin/bash
```

### With Port Forwarding (JupyterLab)

```shell
docker run -it -v ${PWD}:/work -p 53155:53155 --rm --privileged peanoframework/<compiler> /bin/bash
```

## Dockerhub

You can find prebuilt Docker images for each compiler we support at [Dockerhub](https://hub.docker.com/u/peanoframework).

*/
